From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 13:01:03 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 049/140] feat: add live subtitles and online autocrop

Restore the custom expanding navigation dock, add seek-aware translated live captions and reliable SRT generation, support active-player autocrop for online streams, and refresh model catalogs across AI providers.
